{
    "title": "Smolsies 2 - Cute Pet Stories",
    "description": "Love animals, pet games, or cute games? Would you like to hatch your new pet friend & grow your cute family of animals? Discover the world of the kids' favorite virtual fluffy pom-pom animals - hatch, take care of them & watch fun stories in a brand new cute game Smolsies 2! Let's dive in and explore a world of adorable animals, cute pet games & fun stories!\r\n\r\nWelcome to the house of the sweetest fluffy virtual animals, get ready to hatch & enjoy cute games & stories! This time, Smolsies' house is full of surprises, fun stories & fluffy animals! Hatch lovely pets, take care of them, play cute games, discover exciting stories, and watch them unlock fun game features, new rooms, cool gifts, and furniture - all while playing adorable pet games!\r\n\r\n<b>HATCH & TAKE CARE OF PET SMOLSIES</b>\r\n\r\nSmolsies hatch from colorful eggs - collect them, hatch all the precious fluffy animals, and surprise them with cute games! When you hatch a baby pet use a baby food machine to prepare milk bottles, feed babies, watch them grow, and enjoy delightful pet games together!\r\n\r\n<b>WATCH CUTE STORIES OF FLUFFY ANIMALS</b>\r\nExciting storytime, fluffy animals, and cute games await! Discover stories hidden around the house and follow the life of fluffy pet Smolsies! Watch stories to get cool gifts or unlock surprise features! Which of the adorable pet games will be your favorite? Join the fluffy animals in this cute game to find out!\r\n\r\n<b>DISCOVER COOL SURPRISES</b>\r\n\r\nVirtual pet Smolsies are sweet, fluffy, and curious animals, always discovering cute games, stories, and new things around them! The pet house is full of exciting stories, fun gifts, and surprises! Hatch pets & watch fun stories & videos to unlock new rooms, interactive furniture, cool toys, cute decorations, and, of course, exciting pet games!\r\n\r\n<b>PLAY FUN & CUTE GAMES</b>\r\n\r\nExplore a variety of adorable pet games! Jump and collect rewards, compete in a fun racing game, enjoy golf, and unleash your creativity in the cute games of drawing, dancing, and decorating! It's time to get cool prizes, so play TutoTOONS pet games now!\r\n\r\nReady to hatch and take care of fluffy pets, play cute games & have fun discovering cool stories and surprises while playing unique pet games?\r\n\r\nDownload Smolsies 2, a new game about animals from the creators of Smolsies - My Cute Pet House and Fluvsies! Hatch animals, discover cute games & stories, and let your kids enjoy the fun with pet games from TutoTOONS!\r\n\r\nDiscover more about the Smolsies world of fluffy animals:\r\nWEB: smolsiesgame.com\r\nFB: https://www.facebook.com/SmolsiesGame\r\nIG: https://www.instagram.com/smolsiesgame/\r\n\r\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\r\n\r\nAbout TutoTOONS Games for Kids\r\nCrafted and play-tested with kids and toddlers, TutoTOONS games foster kids\u2019 creativity and help them learn while playing the games they love. Fun and educational TutoTOONS games strive to bring meaningful and safe mobile experience to millions of children worldwide.\r\n\r\nImportant Message to Parents\r\nThis app is free to download and play, but there may be certain in-game items that can be purchased for real money. By downloading this app you agree to TutoTOONS Privacy Policy and Terms of Use.\r\n\r\nDiscover More Fun with TutoTOONS!\r\n\u00b7 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/@TutoTOONS\r\n\u00b7 Learn more about us: https://tutotoons.com\r\n\u00b7 Read our blog: https://blog.tutotoons.com\r\n\u00b7 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/tutotoons\r\n\u00b7 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/tutotoons/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Love animals, pet games, or cute games? Would you like to hatch your new pet friend &amp; grow your cute family of animals? Discover the world of the kids&#39; favorite virtual fluffy pom-pom animals - hatch, take care of them &amp; watch fun stories in a brand new cute game Smolsies 2! Let&#39;s dive in and explore a world of adorable animals, cute pet games &amp; fun stories!<br><br>Welcome to the house of the sweetest fluffy virtual animals, get ready to hatch &amp; enjoy cute games &amp; stories! This time, Smolsies&#39; house is full of surprises, fun stories &amp; fluffy animals! Hatch lovely pets, take care of them, play cute games, discover exciting stories, and watch them unlock fun game features, new rooms, cool gifts, and furniture - all while playing adorable pet games!<br><br><b>HATCH &amp; TAKE CARE OF PET SMOLSIES</b><br><br>Smolsies hatch from colorful eggs - collect them, hatch all the precious fluffy animals, and surprise them with cute games! When you hatch a baby pet use a baby food machine to prepare milk bottles, feed babies, watch them grow, and enjoy delightful pet games together!<br><br><b>WATCH CUTE STORIES OF FLUFFY ANIMALS</b><br>Exciting storytime, fluffy animals, and cute games await! Discover stories hidden around the house and follow the life of fluffy pet Smolsies! Watch stories to get cool gifts or unlock surprise features! Which of the adorable pet games will be your favorite? Join the fluffy animals in this cute game to find out!<br><br><b>DISCOVER COOL SURPRISES</b><br><br>Virtual pet Smolsies are sweet, fluffy, and curious animals, always discovering cute games, stories, and new things around them! The pet house is full of exciting stories, fun gifts, and surprises! Hatch pets &amp; watch fun stories &amp; videos to unlock new rooms, interactive furniture, cool toys, cute decorations, and, of course, exciting pet games!<br><br><b>PLAY FUN &amp; CUTE GAMES</b><br><br>Explore a variety of adorable pet games! Jump and collect rewards, compete in a fun racing game, enjoy golf, and unleash your creativity in the cute games of drawing, dancing, and decorating! It&#39;s time to get cool prizes, so play TutoTOONS pet games now!<br><br>Ready to hatch and take care of fluffy pets, play cute games &amp; have fun discovering cool stories and surprises while playing unique pet games?<br><br>Download Smolsies 2, a new game about animals from the creators of Smolsies - My Cute Pet House and Fluvsies! Hatch animals, discover cute games &amp; stories, and let your kids enjoy the fun with pet games from TutoTOONS!<br><br>Discover more about the Smolsies world of fluffy animals:<br>WEB: smolsiesgame.com<br>FB: https://www.facebook.com/SmolsiesGame<br>IG: https://www.instagram.com/smolsiesgame/<br><br>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -<br><br>About TutoTOONS Games for Kids<br>Crafted and play-tested with kids and toddlers, TutoTOONS games foster kids\u2019 creativity and help them learn while playing the games they love. Fun and educational TutoTOONS games strive to bring meaningful and safe mobile experience to millions of children worldwide.<br><br>Important Message to Parents<br>This app is free to download and play, but there may be certain in-game items that can be purchased for real money. By downloading this app you agree to TutoTOONS Privacy Policy and Terms of Use.<br><br>Discover More Fun with TutoTOONS!<br>\u00b7 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/@TutoTOONS<br>\u00b7 Learn more about us: https://tutotoons.com<br>\u00b7 Read our blog: https://blog.tutotoons.com<br>\u00b7 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/tutotoons<br>\u00b7 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/tutotoons/",
